## Lore

A select few Staphra Warriors are chosen for Bio-Borg conversion as the next step toward full Minion status, as the Splugorth have done with the Kydian Powerlords and the Conservators. The Bio-Wizard conversion turns her psionic powers inward, multiplying her strength and endurance; the upgraded warrior is the Staphra Warlord. The Warlords are currently the elite of the Staphra.

## Body

Much like the Warrior, but larger and far more muscular, standing 8 to 9 feet (2.4 to 2.7 m) and weighing 350 to 500 lbs (157.5 to 225 kg), all muscle. A small round creature mounted at the base of her skull is the organism that converts her psychic power into physical might; it was designed for the Staphra and works on no other people. Average life span 55 years.

## GM Notes

Habitat: wherever the Splugorth are; natively forests and grasslands. Slave Market Value: only rogues, renegades and the disobedient are sold, at 100,000-300,000 credits, sometimes a little more. Allies: as the Warrior, and the Kydian Overlords especially like the Warlords as kindred spirits. Enemies: every enemy of the Splugorth.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'staphra-warlord');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'staphra-warlord';

